tile.btx.hemp.name=Hemp
tile.btx.hemp.desc=A useful, hardy crop. Primarily used in the manufacture of Rope and Fabric.
tile.btx.millstone.name=Millstone
tile.btx.millstone.desc=Crushes raw materials into finer materials.
tile.btx.hand.crank.name=Hand Crank
tile.btx.hand.crank.desc=A primitive manual mechanical power generation device.
tile.btx.axle.name=Axle
tile.btx.axle.desc=Lengths of wood bound tightly with rope.
tile.btx.axle.power.source.name=Powered Axle
tile.btx.axle.power.source.desc=An axle that spins on its own, supplying endless mechanical power.
tile.btx.gearbox.name=Gearbox
tile.btx.gearbox.desc=Relays and distributes mechanical power.
tile.btx.hibachi.name=Hibachi
tile.btx.hibachi.desc=The Netherrack of the modern man.
tile.btx.stoked.fire.name=Stoked Fire
tile.btx.stoked.fire.desc=Playing with fire, cheater?
tile.btx.bellows.name=Bellows
tile.btx.bellows.desc=Breathes fury into the flames of a Hibachi. Blows light items away, too.
tile.btx.kiln.name=Kiln Block
tile.btx.kiln.desc=Cheating? That's brick-ly forbidden.
tile.btx.turntable.name=Turntable
tile.btx.turntable.desc=Spins the blocks on top in steady quarter turns.
tile.btx.cauldron.name=Cauldron
tile.btx.cauldron.desc=An iron pot for cooking over fire. Stoke the flames for harsher work.
tile.btx.crucible.name=Crucible
tile.btx.crucible.desc=A fired clay vessel for melting and recovering metals over stoked fire.
tile.btx.unfired.planter.name=Unfired Planter
tile.btx.unfired.planter.desc=Soft, freshly shaped clay. Fire it in a kiln to make a planter.
tile.btx.unfired.crucible.name=Unfired Crucible
tile.btx.unfired.crucible.desc=Soft, freshly shaped clay. Fire it in a kiln to make a crucible.
tile.btx.unfired.vase.name=Unfired Vase
tile.btx.unfired.vase.desc=Soft, freshly shaped clay. Fire it in a kiln to make a vase.
tile.btx.planter.name=Planter
tile.btx.planter.desc=A fired clay pot. Fill it with soil and water to grow things in it.
tile.btx.planter.soil.name=Planter with Soil
tile.btx.planter.soil.desc=Always moist soil for crops. Bone meal fertilizes it.
tile.btx.planter.grass.name=Planter with Grass
tile.btx.planter.grass.desc=A little patch of meadow. Sprouts flowers and grass, and holds sugar cane.
tile.btx.planter.grass.retro.name=Planter with Retro Grass
tile.btx.planter.grass.retro.desc=A little patch of the old world. Sprouts flowers and grass, and holds sugar cane.
tile.btx.planter.grass.scorched.name=Planter with Scorched Grass
tile.btx.planter.grass.scorched.desc=A little patch of sun-baked grass. Sprouts flowers and grass, and holds sugar cane.
tile.btx.hopper.name=Hopper
tile.btx.hopper.desc=Collects items dropped on it and, when powered, drops them out the bottom. Takes a filter.
tile.btx.grate.name=Grate
tile.btx.grate.desc=A lattice of sticks bound with string. Works as a hopper filter for small items.
tile.btx.slats.name=Slats
tile.btx.slats.desc=Thin wooden strips. Works as a hopper filter for flat items.
tile.btx.wicker.pane.name=Wicker Pane
tile.btx.wicker.pane.desc=Woven reeds on a grate frame. Works as a fine hopper filter.
tile.btx.wicker.block.name=Block of Wicker
tile.btx.wicker.block.desc=A solid block of woven wicker. Burns fast.
tile.btx.concentrated.hellfire.block.name=Block of Concentrated Hellfire
tile.btx.concentrated.hellfire.block.desc=Fire burns forever on any side of it.
tile.btx.wicker.slab.name=Wicker Slab
tile.btx.wicker.slab.desc=Half a block of woven wicker. Burns fast.
tile.btx.companion.cube.name=Companion Cube
tile.btx.companion.cube.desc=Your best friend, forever.
tile.btx.companion.slab.name=Companion Slab
tile.btx.companion.slab.desc=Half of your best friend. Put two together for a happy reunion.

