tile.btx.soulforge.name=Soulforge
tile.btx.soulforge.desc=A forge-anvil for working soulforged steel on a 4x4 grid.
tile.btx.saw.name=Saw
tile.btx.saw.desc=Cuts the block in front of its blade when powered by an axle.
tile.btx.block.dispenser.name=Block Dispenser
tile.btx.block.dispenser.desc=Places blocks when powered and swallows them back when unpowered.
tile.btx.detector.block.name=Detector Block
tile.btx.detector.block.desc=Emits a redstone signal when a block or entity is in front of it. Facing up, it also senses rain.
tile.btx.lens.name=Lens
tile.btx.cement.name=Cement
tile.btx.pressure.plate.soulforged.steel.name=Soulforged Steel Pressure Plate
tile.btx.pressure.plate.soulforged.steel.desc=Only triggered by players.
tile.btx.detector.rail.stone.name=Stone Detector Rail
tile.btx.detector.rail.stone.desc=Emits a redstone signal when a loaded minecart passes over it: a chest or furnace cart, or one carrying a rider.
tile.btx.detector.rail.soulforged.steel.name=Soulforged Steel Detector Rail
tile.btx.detector.rail.soulforged.steel.desc=Emits a redstone signal only when a minecart carrying a player passes over it.
tile.btx.buddy.block.name=Buddy Block
tile.btx.buddy.block.desc=Gives a short redstone pulse from its face whenever a block next to it changes.
tile.btx.light.bulb.name=Light Bulb
tile.btx.light.bulb.desc=Lights up brightly when powered by redstone. Doesn't carry redstone power through itself.
tile.btx.light.bulb.on.name=Light Bulb
tile.btx.lens.desc=Projects a beam of light from a bright light source behind it. Placed against a Detector Block, it senses light levels instead.
tile.btx.detector.logic.name=Detector Logic
tile.btx.detector.logic.glowing.name=Detector Logic
tile.btx.anchor.name=Anchor
tile.btx.anchor.desc=Hang rope below it from a wall or ceiling. Right-click with rope to lower, empty-handed to raise.
tile.btx.pulley.name=Pulley
tile.btx.pulley.desc=Feeds rope down from its inventory, and reels it back in when powered by an axle or hand crank. Redstone holds it still.
tile.btx.platform.name=Platform
tile.btx.platform.desc=Rides along with an anchor sitting on top of it when a pulley raises or lowers it.

